@startuml 5.3.4a_v5 Class Diagram Core
skinparam backgroundColor #FFFFFF
skinparam class {
  BackgroundColor #EBF3FB
  BorderColor #2E5FA3
  FontName Arial
  FontSize 11
  HeaderBackgroundColor #2E5FA3
  HeaderFontColor #FFFFFF
  ArrowColor #2E5FA3
}
skinparam stereotypeCBackgroundColor #D5EAD0
skinparam stereotypeIBackgroundColor #FDE8D8
skinparam packageStyle rectangle
skinparam arrow {
  Color #2E5FA3
  FontName Arial
  FontSize 9
}

title Class Diagram [1/2: CORE] - SID Desa Cibenda (v5.2)\nLayer: Controller -> Form Request -> Service -> Repository -> Eloquent Model -> DB (Policy per-resource)\nScope: Auth, penugasan jabatan, kependudukan, pekerjaan, approval dua tahap, surat
Lihat file Class Diagram Pendukung [2/2] untuk: Organisasi Non-Struktural, Notifikasi, Berita, Peraturan Desa

' ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════
' LAYER 1: CONTROLLER
' ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════

package "Controller Layer" #F0F4FF {

  class CurrentUserController {
    +show() : JsonResponse
  }

  class LetterController {
    +index() : JsonResponse
    +show(id) : JsonResponse
    +store(StoreLetterRequest) : JsonResponse
    +destroy(letter) : JsonResponse
    note right
      Daftar/detail bersama untuk seluruh role.
      LetterService menentukan scope daftar;
      LetterPolicy mengotorisasi detail.
    end note
  }

  class RtApprovalController {
    +decision(letter, RtDecisionRequest) : JsonResponse
    note right
      TETAP TERPISAH (tidak digabung ke
      KadesApprovalController) karena
      RT resolve BERBASIS WILAYAH (rt_id),
      pola query & otorisasi beda dengan
      approver berbasis posisi murni.
    end note
  }

  class KadesApprovalController {
    +decision(letter, KadesDecisionRequest) : JsonResponse
    note right
      Controller keputusan final aktif (source).
      Catatan historis: RwApprovalController
      (DIHAPUS - RW bukan approver),
      KadusApprovalController (DIHAPUS -
      Kadus bukan approver), dan
      tidak ada controller keputusan
      terpisah untuk Kasi/Kaur.
      Controller ini melayani approver
      berbasis posisi murni: kepala_desa
      dan sekdes. Route/middleware
      menyaring role di layer otorisasi,
      bukan class Controller terpisah
      per role (Config over Code,
      SID-ARCH-SYS-001 S1).
    end note
  }

  class CitizenController {
    +index() : JsonResponse
    +store(StoreCitizenRequest) : JsonResponse
    +update(id, UpdateCitizenRequest) : JsonResponse
    +import(file, ImportCitizensRequest) : JsonResponse
  }

  class FamilyController {
    +index() : JsonResponse
    +store(StoreFamilyRequest) : JsonResponse
    +update(id, UpdateFamilyRequest) : JsonResponse
    +show(family) : JsonResponse
    +destroy(family) : JsonResponse
    note right
      BARU v5.0. Kelola Kartu Keluarga
      (families) - terpisah dari
      CitizenController karena families
      adalah entity tersendiri sejak
      restrukturisasi kependudukan v5.0.
    end note
  }

  class UserController {
    +index() : JsonResponse
    +update(id, UpdateUserRequest) : JsonResponse
    +resetPassword(id) : JsonResponse
  }

  class OfficialController {
    +promote(PromoteOfficialRequest) : JsonResponse
    +demote(id, DemoteOfficialRequest) : JsonResponse
    +rotate(id, RotateOfficialRequest) : JsonResponse
  }

  class HamletController {
    +manageHamlets() : JsonResponse
    +manageRws() : JsonResponse
    +manageRts() : JsonResponse
  }

  class ApprovalSettingController {
    +index() : JsonResponse
    +update(id, UpdateApprovalSettingRequest) : JsonResponse
  }

  class LetterTypeController {
    +index() : JsonResponse
    +update(id, UpdateLetterTypeRequest) : JsonResponse
    note right
      MVP: hanya edit validity_days,
      assigned_role, toggle is_active
      (UC-21 versi sederhana).
      category_id/flow_id: developer-only
      via seeder di MVP, TIDAK ada endpoint
      edit untuk keduanya.
    end note
  }

  class ApprovalFlowController {
    +index() : JsonResponse
    +show(id) : JsonResponse
    note right
      BARU v5.0, READ-ONLY di MVP.
      Untuk keperluan Frontend menampilkan
      struktur flow (misal preview alur
      approval suatu tipe surat).
      CRUD letter_categories/approval_flows/
      flow_steps TETAP developer-only via
      seeder/migration di MVP - TIDAK ada
      endpoint create/update/delete di sini.
    end note
  }
}

